<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Challenge 4 on Exoscale Academy</title><link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/learning-paths/1e2a8e46-937c-47ea-ab43-5716e3bcab2e/workshop-cka-preparation/11.challenges/challenge4/</link><description>Recent content in Challenge 4 on Exoscale Academy</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/learning-paths/1e2a8e46-937c-47ea-ab43-5716e3bcab2e/workshop-cka-preparation/11.challenges/challenge4/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Solution</title><link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/learning-paths/1e2a8e46-937c-47ea-ab43-5716e3bcab2e/workshop-cka-preparation/11.challenges/challenge4/solution/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/learning-paths/1e2a8e46-937c-47ea-ab43-5716e3bcab2e/workshop-cka-preparation/11.challenges/challenge4/solution/</guid><description>&lt;ol>
&lt;li>Test&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;p>List the resources in &lt;em>app2&lt;/em>&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>$ kubectl get po,svc -n app2
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>NAME READY STATUS RESTARTS AGE
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>pod/nginx 1/1 Running &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">0&lt;/span> 8s
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>NAME TYPE CLUSTER-IP EXTERNAL-IP PORT&lt;span style="color:#f92672">(&lt;/span>S&lt;span style="color:#f92672">)&lt;/span> AGE
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>service/nginx NodePort 10.106.164.238 &amp;lt;none&amp;gt; 80:30000/TCP 8s
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>From a worker node, try to reach the nginx Pod&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>$ curl localhost:30000
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>curl: &lt;span style="color:#f92672">(&lt;/span>7&lt;span style="color:#f92672">)&lt;/span> Failed to connect to localhost port 30000: Connection refused
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;ol start="2">
&lt;li>Check the service&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>kubectl describe svc nginx -n app2
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Name: nginx
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Namespace: app2
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Labels: &amp;lt;none&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Annotations: &amp;lt;none&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Selector: app&lt;span style="color:#f92672">=&lt;/span>nginx
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Type: NodePort
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>IP Family Policy: SingleStack
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>IP Families: IPv4
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>IP: 10.106.164.238
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>IPs: 10.106.164.238
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Port: &amp;lt;unset&amp;gt; 80/TCP
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>TargetPort: 80/TCP
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>NodePort: &amp;lt;unset&amp;gt; 30000/TCP
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Endpoints: &amp;lt;none&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Session Affinity: None
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>External Traffic Policy: Cluster
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Events: &amp;lt;none&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>The list of &lt;em>Endpoints&lt;/em> is empty, that is surely a problem. The Service&amp;rsquo;s selector is &lt;em>app: nginx&lt;/em>, let&amp;rsquo;s see the content of the Pod&amp;rsquo;s labels.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>